# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit Paulice"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung für die neueste Version von Qiskit Paulice"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Installationsanleitung {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Voraussetzungen {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Erstelle zunächst eine minimale Umgebung, in der nur Python installiert ist. Wir empfehlen die Verwendung von [virtuellen Python-Umgebungen](https://docs.python.org/3.10/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktiviere deine neue Umgebung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Es gibt zwei Hauptwege, dieses Paket zu installieren: von PyPI oder aus dem Quellcode. Die bevorzugte Methode ist die Installation von PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Von PyPI installieren {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Aus dem Quellcode installieren {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du im Repository entwickeln oder die Notebooks lokal ausführen möchtest, solltest du aus dem Quellcode installieren.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `qiskit-paulice` repository.\n"
msgstr "Klone zunächst das Repository `qiskit-paulice`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Installiere als Nächstes die Rust-Toolchain, aktualisiere pip und wechsle in das Repository. Anweisungen zur Installation der Toolchain findest du in der [Rust-Dokumentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-paulice` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Der nächste Schritt ist die Installation von `qiskit-paulice` in der virtuellen Umgebung. Wenn du die Notebooks und ihre Visualisierungen ausführen möchtest, installiere die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten. Wenn du im Repository entwickeln möchtest, installiere die `dev`-Abhängigkeiten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Passe die folgenden Optionen an deine Bedürfnisse an.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Wenn du die Notebook-Abhängigkeiten installiert hast, kannst du loslegen, indem du die Notebooks in der Dokumentation ausführst.\n"
